# The walks pumakins-unwrap took for #4585 and #4708.  The wrist pitch,
# joint 5, is left out: at +-180 the wrist is folded back on itself, a
# singularity where joints 4 and 6 are not determined.
# joints 4 and 6 together from 150 and 140
loadrt pumakins
loadrt walkcheck start=20,-20,100,150,35,140 mask=40
